      <h2>FlashPaper</h2>
      <p><strong><a href='https://github.com/liskl/FlashPaper'>FlashPaper</a></strong> is a zero-knowledge, self-destructing encrypted pastebin written in Go. It reimplements <a href='https://github.com/PrivateBin/PrivateBin'>PrivateBin</a> with full API compatibility, so existing PrivateBin clients work against it unchanged.</p>

